OL,3,ATrump leaves China after holding
OL,4,Ahistoric 90-minute talks with Xi and
OL,5,APutin
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump has left China after
OL,8,Fholding talks for about 90 minutes with
OL,9,FRussian President Vladimir Putin and Xi
OL,10,FJinping in the city of Shenzhen
OL,12,FFollowing the summit, the US, China and
OL,13,FRussia issue a "joint declaration on
OL,14,Fpeace", in which they say "nuclear war
OL,15,Fcannot be won and must never be fought"
OL,17,FIn footage released by the Kremlin of
OL,18,Fhim leaving the venue, Putin says to Xi
OL,19,F"I don't think anyone even expected
OL,20,Feverything to go so well"
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
